# Build artifacts. The .uf2 files are the deliberate exception and are committed:
# a reviewer with the same board can flash the exact build this README describes.
firmware/*.hex
firmware/*.zip
*.o
*.obj
*.elf
*.map

# The Nordic nRF52840 product specification is 18 MB and is Nordic's to
# distribute. Read it from nordicsemi.com; it is not redistributed here.
nRF52840_PS_v1.1.pdf

